WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.400
The live desk arm moves through home, reach_left, lift, and reach_right.

00:05.400 --> 00:10.800
The cycle repeats. The highlighted strip and right panel show the current FSM state.

00:10.800 --> 00:16.300
Yaw, shoulder, elbow, and extension values update as the servo approaches each target.

00:16.300 --> 00:21.700
Colored axes show the link frames. The external viewer uses live /xform_world matrices.

00:21.700 --> 00:27.100
Arrival requires all target errors within tolerance and at least 1.3 seconds in the state.

00:27.100 --> 00:30.100
The FSM returns home and begins another cycle. This is a kinematic demonstration.
